      "content": "but the \"moments in between\" feel so heavy and exhausting. like, why should I keep pushing through the struggle just to enjoy a few temporary moments if the end result is the same? if the math of the universe says everything is zero, then all this effort feels like a lie. it's just... a lot of noise for nothing.",
